       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DATABIND.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-UNIQUE PIC X.
       01 GROUP-A.
          05 DUPLICATE-ITEM PIC X.
       01 GROUP-B.
          05 DUPLICATE-ITEM PIC X.
       01 OUTER-GROUP.
          05 MIDDLE-GROUP.
             10 LEAF-ITEM PIC X.
          05 OTHER-GROUP.
             10 MIDDLE-GROUP.
                15 LEAF-ITEM PIC X.
       01 FLAG PIC X.
          88 FLAG-ON VALUE 'Y'.
       01 NORMAL-ITEM PIC X.
       01 TABLE-COUNT PIC 9.
       01 TABLE-ITEM OCCURS 1 TO 5 TIMES
          DEPENDING ON TABLE-COUNT INDEXED BY TABLE-IDX
          PIC X.
       01 REDEFINED-ITEM PIC X.
       01 REDEFINING-ITEM REDEFINES REDEFINED-ITEM PIC X.
       66 RANGE-ALIAS RENAMES REDEFINED-ITEM THRU REDEFINING-ITEM.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE WS-UNIQUE TO FLAG.
           MOVE DUPLICATE-ITEM TO FLAG.
           MOVE DUPLICATE-ITEM OF GROUP-A TO FLAG.
           MOVE DUPLICATE-ITEM IN GROUP-B TO FLAG.
           MOVE LEAF-ITEM OF MIDDLE-GROUP OF OUTER-GROUP TO FLAG.
           MOVE LEAF-ITEM OF OUTER-GROUP OF MIDDLE-GROUP TO FLAG.
           MOVE MISSING-ITEM TO FLAG.
           IF FLAG-ON
               CONTINUE
           END-IF.
           IF NORMAL-ITEM
               CONTINUE
           END-IF.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM DATABIND.
